      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have friends who are of a variety of ages and no matter the age it's fun to hang out with them. I think if we added age groups, players would stop interacting with each other. If VRChat stops becoming a social platform then I think the community aspect could lose it's value.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-25T05:09:06.408Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So there is a lot of people with different age on this game and it is hard to tell who is who and how old they are. There should be a way to see if the user is above 18 years old or not. That way, you can get an idea of how old the person is without getting the exact age. If you are under 18, consider the user as a teenager. If the user is above 18, consider it as an adult. This is crucial when it comes to social features for a game like VRChat. Also, people could set up a warning pop-up if an adult player sends a friend request to a teenager player.",
